    <description>Sourcing pipeline — Step 3 of 7, RFP release + demo bid intake. Stands in for the human "Category Manager releases the RFP" interactive step, and simulates the supplier panel responding by seeding a set of example Supplier_Bid__c records against the request (this is the ONLY place example supplier names / raw component scores live — clearly-labelled demo seed data; the downstream Evaluate Bids flow reads and scores whatever bids exist, hardcoding nothing). Returns a "Released" decision. Swap in the real interactive screen flow Skywave_Sourcing_Issue_RFP once work-item assignment is available; real bids would arrive from suppliers rather than this seed.</description>
